  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your studies focus upon mastery of the Codex of Heart and Mind.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ability to recite 2nd-level recitations from the Codex of Heart and Mind</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You immediately learn an additional recitation from the Codex of Heart and Mind whose recitation level is at least 1 lower than the highest recitation level you can recite.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/truemagic-feats#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
